{"completed": true, "response": "之前适度的亲近让他感到安心和满足，所以现在这份温柔不只是当下舒服，也慢慢变得重要，成了他真正放在心上的东西。亲近带来的满足依然存在，他对自己能否保持自主的顾虑也没有消失，只是还没有超过这份满足。此刻他在意得还很轻，没有变成要求，也没有明确想到未来，只是让这份本来就让他满足的亲近，多了一层值得珍惜的感觉。", "metadata": {"session_handle": "279e34e0-7e01-4ba3-b415-d7806b663fb3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003042968042Z", "elapsed_seconds": 5.359, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T00:30:48.334544+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "907350e9046ab403ba5a69b53ea297188f3aa0736467cc44ab19e83f3ff6e5a0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T003042968042Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "35